<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Healthcare started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Healthcare started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Chicago Corp healthcare analyst Peter Costa said he started coverage of United Healthcare Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the largest U.S. managed care company were up 2-3/4 to 40.</p>
<p>--&quot;United's national presence and the potential of converting indemnity-based MetraHealth members should continue to propel United's commercial enrollment growth above the industry average,&quot; Costa said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
